  "holistic_F_N": 2,
  "holistic_F_H": -2,
  "section_notes": "S2 sets 5% as a corrective-action trigger only, with no sales stop and an open-ended remediation period, which keeps the Hearth 10 on sale. S5 makes exceedance of 8 per 100,000 per model a mandatory recall, which would reach the Ember 8 at 9.9, while S3's 6-year retrofit deadline and S4's 36-month suppression start both fall within the red lines. Customers receive per-model results but these are not published to the general public."
